Just have to gloat really.  Sunday evening, I noticed that a rogue ( Khendon ) that I've grouped with twice and have since kept in sporatic contact from the "Jesters"  guild was in Steamfont.  So I sent him a tell asking him what was up and he said he was after Renux for another part of his Rogue Epic.  I asked him if he needed/wanted some more help, he said "Yes! Please!" and I even maanged to talk Valraukar, our wizard evacer to dangerous places and crew into going too.<P>We arrive, spend about 15 minutes getting organized and buffed and then set out to trigger Renux.  The 3-4 group raid kills her without too much trouble and not just 1 ravenscale masks drop, but two!  I congratulate Khendon on completing another part to his epic and get TL'ed to Nektolus so I can go heckle Lownar before I goto bed.<P>Get a tell saying that I won one of the extra RS Masks.  No way!  So, I get Valraukar to grab it for me and give it to Meekka.<P>All I can say is, "Holy shit!"  The mask is awesome for a rogue.  <P>AC8 +5CHA +10PR Effect: See Inviso<P>Effect is active all the time, no right click and geez that totaly roxors for a rogue!<P>--------------------<P>Verser - Bard of the 51st Song<BR>Sleethr - 54th DE Mage<BR>Medec - 41st level Battle Cleric<BR>Meekka - 31st DE Rogue<BR>Vowk - 27th Dr00d
